    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab064141c22b895cead3616",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这根本超出了“身体不太好”的等级。\n她的虚弱和异常……简直跟怪异没两样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8325cf465864429a08a313068b15c1a3e3526e5ff01d09fef893b95de979b5da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
